{
  "sourceLanguage" : "zh-Hans",
  "strings" : {
    "%@：%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 条" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld entries"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 条可疑" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld to check"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 条有错" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld errors"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 条没有页码" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld entries have no page"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 条页码比上一条小。仍然写入？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld entries have a lower page than the previous one. Write anyway?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "-目录" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "-outline"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mulu v0.1 还不能给加密的 PDF 写目录。如果你知道密码，可以在「预览」里打开它，用「文件 ▸ 导出为 PDF…」存一份不加密的副本，再用 Mulu 打开那份副本。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mulu 0.1 cannot add an outline to encrypted PDFs yet. If you know the password, open it in Preview, save an unencrypted copy with File ▸ Export as PDF…, and open that copy in Mulu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mulu 只把目录写进新的 PDF；没有写入的修改会丢失。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mulu writes outlines only into new PDFs; unwritten changes will be lost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mulu 只能打开 PDF 文件。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mulu can only open PDF files."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mulu 只能打开 PDF。“%@”不是 PDF。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mulu opens PDFs only. “%@” is not a PDF."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mulu 文本" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mulu Text"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mulu 无法处理这个 PDF" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mulu cannot process this PDF"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PDF 原有目录的页码是固定页，不随偏移变" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pages from the PDF's existing outline are pinned and do not follow the offset"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PDF 的物理页，也就是缩略图下面的数字。最多 %lld 页。中文标点（，、～ 至）也可以。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Physical PDF pages, the numbers under the thumbnails. At most %lld pages. Chinese punctuation (，、～ 至) works too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PDF 第 %lld 页 / 共 %lld 页" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PDF page %lld of %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PDF 页 = 印刷页 + 偏移" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PDF page = printed page + offset"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PDF 预览" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PDF preview"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PDF补丁丁 XML" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PDFPatcher XML"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 无法显示这个 PDF（可能已损坏）。仍然可以粘贴或导入目录，然后写入。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS cannot display this PDF (it may be damaged). You can still paste or import an outline and write it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 无法读取这个 PDF 的页面，不能识别目录页；可以粘贴或导入目录再写入" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS cannot read this PDF’s pages, so TOC pages cannot be recognized; paste or import an outline, then write it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "pdfdir 文本" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "pdfdir Text"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@”有 %@，不像目录文件（目录文件最多 %@）。当前目录没有改动。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” is %@, too large for an outline file (at most %@). The current outline was not changed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@”没有被导入，当前目录没有改动。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” was not imported; the current outline is unchanged."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@”的目录修改还没有写入 PDF。仍然关闭？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The outline changes to “%@” are not written to a PDF. Close anyway?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "…还有 %lld 处" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "…and %lld more"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌃Tab / ⌃⇧Tab 把焦点移出表格。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⌃Tab / ⌃⇧Tab move the focus out of the table."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "① 在预览里翻到印着目录的那几页，逐页勾选上方的「这是目录页」（或按住 ⌘ 点左边的缩略图）。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. In the preview, go to the pages with the printed table of contents and tick “This is a TOC page” above it on each one (or ⌘-click the thumbnails on the left)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "② 点「识别目录页…」，把目录读成可以修改的草稿。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Click “Recognize TOC Pages…” to turn them into a draft you can correct."
          }
        }
      }
    },
